# ─── SecuringAI / LLM Dojo — environment ──────────────────────────────────────
# All variables are OPTIONAL. With nothing set, the app runs in deterministic
# Stub Mode: all scenarios, scoring, and UI are fully functional, only the
# free-form model output is replaced with a stub message.
#
# To enable real AI replies in Dojo 2/3 (and the benign/probing path in Dojo 1),
# set OPENAI_API_KEY. Dojo 1 attack outcomes are deterministic regardless and
# never call out to a model provider.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
